      "message": "Hi Jameson,\n\nUCSI classifies as a module. From 6.12 onwards, we have a split of the kernel into core (the repo you commit right now) and vendor modules. You can read more about the design here: go/al-gki-6.12-design.\n\nPTAL at go/al-gki-contributing for guideliens. In your particular case, to turn UCSI to an out-of-tree vendor module with downstream changes, please follow go/al-gki-vmm. If you have issues with that, feel free to ask questions at http://go/al-gki-6.12-chat\n\nFYI: I\u0027ll be out-of-office next week, you can add as reviewer of DDK module @korneld instead or wait until I\u0027m back.",
